hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Kitab al-Taharah. Al-Lului ne kaha: Abu Dawud Sulayman ibn al-Ashath ne hum se bayan kiya: Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Sulayman ibn Abi al-Saib ne humein khabar di, Talhah ibn Abi Qanan se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab peshab ka irada farmate to zameen ke sakht oonch-neech hisse ki taraf tashreef le jate, ek lakdi lete aur us se mitti ko karidte yahan tak ke woh narm ho jati, phir peshab farmate."
"2","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Hassan ne humein khabar di, al-Hasan se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab bait al-khala me dakhil hote to farmate: Ae Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun khabees o mookhbis, galeez o napaak, mardood shaitan se."
"3","Hisham ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne humein khabar di, Ibn Jabir se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne masjid ke darwazon par peshab karne se mana farmaya."
"4","Amr ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne humein khabar di, Zamah ibn Salih se, Isa ibn Azdad se, un ke walid se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi peshab kare to use chahiye ke apne zakar ko teen martaba jhatke."
"5","Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne humein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Khalid al-Qurashi se, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, unhon ne kaha ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum piyo to choos choos kar piyo, aur jab miswak karo to arz me karo."
